          "Meanwhile astrid/packs/validate.py:21 does `import yaml` and other manifest-adjacent code (executor/cli.py:190) does `import yaml as _yaml_module`. PyYAML is already an effective dependency.",
          "The comment in pack.py implies the hand-rolled parser is to keep `core` import-light, but the cost is a divergent parser at the same boundary the rest of the system uses real YAML for."
