          "astrid/core/worker/banodoco_worker.py:228-231: `if claim is None: time.sleep(self.config.idle_sleep_sec); continue` \u2014 the long-poll loop cannot distinguish 'no work' from 'wrong service-role key' and will sleep indefinitely.",
