          "Most fields across these interfaces are typed `unknown`, so the interfaces enumerate property names without type content \u2014 the type provides spelling guarantees only.",
          "type Clip = TimelineClip (line 350) leaves a third name floating around for the same shape, used throughout TimelineConfig.clips."
