          "Same file declares `\"@types/react\": \"^19.2.14\"` and `\"@types/react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\"` in devDependencies.",
          "@types/react v19 reflects React-19 API surface changes (e.g. ReactNode no longer includes bigint, ref typing changes, FC children removal) \u2014 types describe a runtime that isn't installed; tsc will accept code that breaks at runtime and reject code that runs.",
          "Remotion 4.0.455 still supports React 18, so the runtime pin is intentional \u2014 the type pin is the drift."
